WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.216 --> 00:00:08.538
"Zing, stop that!"

2
00:00:09.138 --> 00:00:16.121
a voice cried from the darkness.

3
00:00:16.881 --> 00:00:17.782
A light flared.

4
00:00:18.702 --> 00:00:21.283
Gasping in pain, Zann dropped to the floor.

5
00:00:22.764 --> 00:00:25.485
Zing flew around his head, whistling irritably.

6
00:00:25.505 --> 00:00:27.426
"Sorry about that."

7
00:00:27.866 --> 00:00:32.288
Saffa hurried forward and touched Zann's arm, instantly healing the burns.

8
00:00:33.056 --> 00:00:36.398
"He's been a little excitable ever since we brought him down here."

9
00:00:36.418 --> 00:00:39.139
"Sorry you got burned, Zann."

10
00:00:39.359 --> 00:00:42.780
Teplo's assistant, Fala, stepped into view behind Saffa.

11
00:00:43.601 --> 00:00:47.162
"We zapped your dragon here as soon as we realized you kids had disappeared."

12
00:00:47.182 --> 00:00:48.963
"That's okay.

13
00:00:49.343 --> 00:00:50.404
I'm used to getting burned."

14
00:00:50.764 --> 00:00:52.745
Zann scratched Zing on the head.

15
00:00:53.465 --> 00:00:54.345
Then he looked up.

16
00:00:55.406 --> 00:00:57.427
His friends were peering down anxiously.

17
00:00:57.447 --> 00:00:58.947
"It's okay!"

18
00:00:59.107 --> 00:00:59.487
he called.

19
00:00:59.507 --> 00:01:00.448
"I'm fine."

20
00:01:01.688 --> 00:01:05.851
Once the others were inside, Fala closed the hatch with a snap of her fingers.

21
00:01:05.871 --> 00:01:11.013
"I'm glad you're here," Saffa told the kids.

22
00:01:11.594 --> 00:01:14.095
She chuckled as Zing snuggled up to Darb.

23
00:01:14.115 --> 00:01:16.737
"I think Zing's glad too."

24
00:01:16.757 --> 00:01:22.420
"Thanks." Zann eyed Teplo's sniffer goose, which had just waddled into sight.

25
00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:23.821
"Teplo sent us."

26
00:01:23.841 --> 00:01:25.962
"Are the prisoners okay?"

27
00:01:26.142 --> 00:01:26.802
Fala asked.

28
00:01:26.822 --> 00:01:29.484
"They seem to be," Gliss said.

29
00:01:30.124 --> 00:01:31.945
"My uncle is with them now too."

30
00:01:31.965 --> 00:01:34.365
"Oh dear."

31
00:01:34.685 --> 00:01:35.886
Saffa shook her head.

32
00:01:35.906 --> 00:01:42.228
"It seems as if anyone who was close to Boz or Zann's parents is being taken into custody.

33
00:01:43.208 --> 00:01:46.269
Fala and I were afraid we'd be next on the list.

34
00:01:46.829 --> 00:01:49.050
That's why we went into hiding.

35
00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:54.091
I'm just glad my husband is traveling far from First City right now."

36
00:01:54.111 --> 00:01:56.352
"Is Venna in the dungeon?"

37
00:01:56.552 --> 00:01:57.232
Fala asked.

38
00:01:58.192 --> 00:02:00.593
"No, we didn't see her there," Perda replied.

39
00:02:00.613 --> 00:02:04.895
"Good." Saffa paced around the small room.

40
00:02:04.915 --> 00:02:07.256
"Let's hope it stays that way."

41
00:02:07.276 --> 00:02:11.998
"She said she had an alibi for the time when the relics went missing," Zann said.

42
00:02:12.818 --> 00:02:13.739
Saffa nodded.

43
00:02:13.759 --> 00:02:15.279
"That may be true.

44
00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:19.701
But this situation seems to be about more than the missing relics."

45
00:02:20.962 --> 00:02:21.742
"What do you mean?"

46
00:02:21.922 --> 00:02:22.543
Darb asked.

47
00:02:22.563 --> 00:02:25.484
"Who's ordering the guards to take all those prisoners?"

48
00:02:26.764 --> 00:02:28.665
"We have no idea," Fala said.

49
00:02:28.685 --> 00:02:30.866
"That's what troubles us the most."

50
00:02:31.746 --> 00:02:33.747
"We might know," Gliss blurted out.

51
00:02:33.767 --> 00:02:35.188
"I hope we're wrong.

52
00:02:35.668 --> 00:02:37.629
But we need to tell you something."

53
00:02:38.609 --> 00:02:39.329
"What is it?"

54
00:02:39.469 --> 00:02:40.170
Saffa asked.

55
00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:43.471
The kids explained what had happened with Morb.

56
00:02:43.491 --> 00:02:45.932
"Uh-oh," Fala muttered.

57
00:02:45.952 --> 00:02:47.393
"This is bad."

58
00:02:47.413 --> 00:02:51.194
"Do you think Morb could be imprisoning Reds again?"

59
00:02:51.434 --> 00:02:52.155
Gliss asked.

60
00:02:52.175 --> 00:02:54.996
"I doubt it," Saffa said.

61
00:02:55.676 --> 00:02:59.379
"Reds were already being imprisoned before Morb escaped from you."

62
00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:01.741
She started pacing again.

63
00:03:01.761 --> 00:03:04.704
"But he's no doubt up to something."

64
00:03:04.724 --> 00:03:07.786
"Yes." Fala sounded grim.

65
00:03:07.806 --> 00:03:13.070
"And Magica is extremely weak right now with all the political turmoil.

66
00:03:14.071 --> 00:03:20.036
If Morb shows up, he'll have a good chance of carrying out his evil plans—whatever they are."

67
00:03:20.056 --> 00:03:24.360
"He probably wants to take over Magica again," Perda said.

68
00:03:25.248 --> 00:03:26.188
Gliss shuddered.

69
00:03:26.488 --> 00:03:27.829
"Or destroy it!"

70
00:03:29.009 --> 00:03:30.610
Saffa hardly seemed to hear them.

71
00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:33.791
"We need to find out if he's back in Magica yet."

72
00:03:34.731 --> 00:03:37.051
She snapped her fingers, and the Directory appeared.

73
00:03:37.071 --> 00:03:38.812
"Morb!" she said.

74
00:03:39.692 --> 00:03:41.473
The Directory showed Morb's page.

75
00:03:42.033 --> 00:03:45.754
It hadn't been updated since Wyssa had taken him away several months earlier.

76
00:03:45.774 --> 00:03:49.015
"Hmm." Fala scanned the entry.

77
00:03:49.835 --> 00:03:50.455
"That's good.

78
00:03:51.035 --> 00:03:52.576
But we shouldn't be too happy.

79
00:03:53.156 --> 00:03:55.598
Morb might have tampered with his entry somehow."

80
00:03:55.618 --> 00:03:59.480
"That sounds like something he'd do," Perda said.

81
00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:05.103
"Maybe he put a Disguising spell on himself so the Directory didn't recognize him when he returned to

82
00:04:05.163 --> 00:04:11.427
Magica. Or maybe he put a spell on the Directory itself, so it couldn't update his entry.

83
00:04:11.968 --> 00:04:13.729
A Dousing spell might work for that."

84
00:04:13.749 --> 00:04:18.371
"If we don't trust the Directory, how can we find out if Morb is here?"

85
00:04:18.612 --> 00:04:19.152
Zann said.

86
00:04:20.184 --> 00:04:21.906
"Let's do a Tracking spell."

87
00:04:22.086 --> 00:04:23.507
Saffa glanced at Fala.

88
00:04:23.527 --> 00:04:26.089
"Do we have access to anything Morb owned?"

89
00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:27.771
Fala nodded.

90
00:04:28.671 --> 00:04:33.115
After digging through a drawer for a moment, she pulled out a ring with a glowing stone.

91
00:04:33.135 --> 00:04:34.216
"What's that?"

92
00:04:34.456 --> 00:04:35.097
Zann asked.

93
00:04:35.117 --> 00:04:37.099
"It's from another world.

94
00:04:37.639 --> 00:04:41.702
After Morb's first defeat, the Magic Masters searched his lair.

95
00:04:42.603 --> 00:04:45.546
Teplo found this and decided to keep it as a souvenir."

96
00:04:45.566 --> 00:04:48.168
"Perfect," Saffa said.

97
00:04:48.736 --> 00:04:50.918
"We can use it as our focusing object."

98
00:04:50.938 --> 00:04:54.862
"Oh, I've read about this kind of Tracking spell!"

99
00:04:55.062 --> 00:04:56.203
Perda looked excited.

100
00:04:56.223 --> 00:05:01.788
"If you have an object that belongs to someone, you can use it to draw you toward that

101
00:05:01.868 --> 00:05:07.132
person." "I thought using magic to track other people was illegal."

102
00:05:07.473 --> 00:05:08.714
Gliss sounded worried.

103
00:05:08.734 --> 00:05:11.136
"It is," Saffa said.

104
00:05:11.156 --> 00:05:14.118
"But this is more important than any law."

105
00:05:14.939 --> 00:05:15.760
Zann nodded.

106
00:05:16.156 --> 00:05:18.637
"If Morb is back in Magica, we need to know.

107
00:05:19.077 --> 00:05:19.617
Let's do it!"

108
00:05:20.818 --> 00:05:26.720
He and his friends watched while Saffa and Fala prepared the spell, creating a mixture of powders and

109
00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:32.103
liquids. "That looks like one of Wyssa's potions," Perda whispered to Zann.

110
00:05:33.143 --> 00:05:34.584
Soon the potion was ready.

111
00:05:35.424 --> 00:05:37.585
Saffa carefully dipped the ring in it.

112
00:05:37.605 --> 00:05:42.947
"Now the ring will pull us toward its owner," Saffa told the kids.

113
00:05:42.967 --> 00:05:45.328
"In this case, Morb."

114
00:05:46.284 --> 00:05:49.346
Fala snapped her fingers; the hatch popped open.

115
00:05:50.227 --> 00:05:51.508
Saffa glanced at the kids.

116
00:05:51.528 --> 00:05:53.549
"You kids should stay here.

117
00:05:54.029 --> 00:05:54.850
It'll be safer."

118
00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:56.391
"No way!"

119
00:05:56.631 --> 00:05:57.172
Zann said.

120
00:05:57.192 --> 00:05:59.373
"We were the ones who released Morb."

121
00:05:59.393 --> 00:06:02.856
"By accident," Gliss mumbled.

122
00:06:04.016 --> 00:06:04.997
Zann nodded.

123
00:06:05.017 --> 00:06:06.298
"By accident.

124
00:06:06.618 --> 00:06:08.239
But we still want to help find him."

125
00:06:08.259 --> 00:06:10.081
"And stop him!"

126
00:06:10.301 --> 00:06:10.941
Perda added.

127
00:06:11.882 --> 00:06:14.664
Saffa eyed them for a moment and then nodded.

128
00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:15.860
"All right.

129
00:06:16.321 --> 00:06:18.662
But let's leave the dragon and the goose here.

130
00:06:18.902 --> 00:06:20.823
They'll only attract attention."

131
00:06:20.843 --> 00:06:25.305
"Sorry, little buddy," Zann said as Zing tried to follow them.

132
00:06:26.106 --> 00:06:27.126
"You need to stay here."

133
00:06:29.027 --> 00:06:32.870
Once outside, the group walked along, following the pull of the ring.

134
00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:39.873
The object led them out of Teplo's neighborhood, across the river, and along several winding streets.

135
00:06:40.874 --> 00:06:42.575
Soon they were in Wormwood.

136
00:06:43.515 --> 00:06:44.476
Fala looked around.

137
00:06:44.796 --> 00:06:49.422
"Maybe Morb is here trying to procure some magic items from the locals."

138
00:06:50.883 --> 00:06:53.346
But the ring didn't lead toward any of the huts.

139
00:06:54.447 --> 00:06:58.232
Instead it pulled them straight to the Wormwood wormhole!
